<speak>
<s>This is your briefing for <say-as interpret-as="date" format="dmy">20062026</say-as>.</s>
<break time="1s"/>
<prosody rate="95%">
<s>Forty-seven Lebanese were killed before Friday's ceasefire took hold... just forty-eight hours after Iran and the United States signed the memo meant to end their war.</s> <s>That deal deferred Lebanon entirely, leaving a second front the diplomats never settled, and Tehran has now warned Washington it would strike Israel without notice if the bombardment continues.</s> <s>Israel and Lebanon are due to meet in Washington next week, while technical talks in Switzerland sit postponed.</s>
</prosody>
<p>
<s>In politics.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Poland has stripped Ukraine's president of its highest state honour, the Order of the White Eagle.</s> <s>Kyiv named a military unit after fighters tied to the nineteen forty-three Volhynia massacres, which Poland classifies as the genocide of one hundred thousand Poles, and the rupture sets two wartime allies feuding over historical memory while Moscow watches.</s> <s>Prime Minister Tusk must still countersign the revocation, and he's called for calm on both sides.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Taiwan has been shut out of an ocean conservation forum at Beijing's insistence.</s> <s>The venue was a so-called Track Two platform, an informal scientific channel where China can apply political pressure without holding any formal right to exclude, and it extends cross-strait coercion into apolitical environmental cooperation.</s> <s>Scientists warn the move creates a template... and the marine ecosystem the forum exists to protect pays the price.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>In Mexico, criminal groups are now recruiting through social-media influencers.</s> <s>One influencer, whose narco branding drew a following, was kidnapped for it, illustrating how organized crime now buys reach the way it once bought silence, laundering reputation and pulling young recruits online.</s> <s>The posts are routinely deleted and the reporting contested, leaving these networks documented yet stubbornly resistant to prosecution.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>South Africa's suspended Hawks chief told a commission that two hundred million rand in cocaine was stolen from a police evidence room by the very guards meant to protect it.</s> <s>He testified he was then removed from his office at gunpoint after first speaking to the inquiry in January, a sign of how deep cartel infiltration runs inside the state's own crime-fighting body.</s> <s>The Madlanga Commission's work continues, with its central allegations still untested.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Chad has expelled Médecins Sans Frontières and cut off care for Sudanese refugees.</s> <s>The government, aligned with Sudan's Rapid Support Forces, cited the group's own internal findings as grounds, after the charity dismissed eighteen staff over fifty-nine abuse allegations.</s> <s>A fact-finding committee now has thirty days... while the displaced wait without the clinics they relied on.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Colombians vote Sunday in a runoff that pits militarization against negotiation.</s> <s>Official figures show twenty-five years and fifteen billion dollars in American aid have failed to cut cocaine output, and the two candidates now offer opposite cures — force and eradication, or development and voluntary substitution.</s> <s>The winner also inherits Colombia's contested oil-export future, making this a fork for the whole region.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>On the economy.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Gulf creditors are throttling Pakistan's drive into African markets.</s> <s>Analysts say Saudi Arabia's shifting priorities cut the support Islamabad needed, exposing how thoroughly Pakistan's foreign ambitions depend on creditor approval rather than its own resources.</s> <s>Those Africa plans remain frozen, with no clear path to thaw them.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Russia will put Western-independent payment systems on the agenda of its Africa summit this October.</s> <s>Foreign Minister Sergei Lavrov framed the gathering in Moscow around energy, nuclear power, and rails that route money beyond Western reach, part of a wider bid to draw the continent into a parallel financial order.</s> <s>So far no African government has announced a commitment.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>India's Jio has filed for an initial public offering with the market regulator.</s> <s>The carrier runs the country's largest wireless network, with five hundred million subscribers, and media reports estimate the offering at four billion dollars — a landmark test of investor appetite for Indian digital infrastructure.</s> <s>The regulator must still clear the prospectus before any shares can trade.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>In science.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Bubbles just one hundred nanometres across don't float — they scour.</s> <s>At that scale, surface tension keeps the bubbles submerged long enough to strip oil, algae, and other pollutants from water, a counterintuitive bit of physics that turns instability into a cleaning tool.</s> <s>Researcher Wen Zhang is now testing it on open-water algal blooms and contaminated waterways.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>In Italy, gut transplants from young mice restored brain plasticity in old ones.</s> <s>Researchers in Pisa found that gut bacteria producing certain fatty acids reopened the learning windows that normally close in adolescence, reversing a condition thought irreversible after childhood.</s> <s>The specific microbial strains haven't been identified, and human application remains distant.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>The James Webb Space Telescope has found an identical light-absorbing compound on both Titan and Pluto that matches no known substance.</s> <s>Both worlds share nitrogen-methane atmospheres, and researchers at the Paris Observatory say no laboratory spectrum on Earth fits the signal.</s> <s>NASA's Dragonfly lands on Titan in twenty thirty-four, and it could finally name what we're seeing.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Climate scientists have now formally accepted that the one-point-five degree limit will be breached.</s> <s>A major report on carbon dioxide removal sets a target of eight-point-eight billion tonnes a year by twenty fifty, nearly four times today's capacity, conceding that the world will overshoot and must claw carbon back afterward.</s> <s>No funding mechanism exists for a gap that runs into the trillions.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>In technology.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Chinese makers now dominate the action-camera and robot-vacuum markets that American brands invented.</s> <s>By combining supply-chain scale with faster release cycles, they displaced the incumbents, and one pioneer's share of the action-camera market fell from seventy-five percent to eighteen percent in just three years.</s> <s>It's a template the displaced firms have yet to answer.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>A review of eighty-five studies finds that medical AI now handles diagnosis but defers to doctors on high-stakes treatment.</s> <s>The division of labour tracks inherent risk, the British researchers found, and the field's measure of success is quietly shifting from raw diagnostic accuracy toward clinical efficiency.</s> <s>No health regulator has yet issued binding rules on where the line should sit.</s>
</p>
<break time="1s"/>
<prosody rate="90%">
<s>That's your briefing.</s>
</prosody>
</speak>